# .rscignore — belt-and-suspenders guard for shinyapps.io deployment.
# deploy.R already whitelists only the needed files; this is a second layer
# so secrets/large files never get bundled even on a plain deployApp() call.
.Renviron
.RData
.Rhistory
.git
archive/
cache/
met/
out/
renv/library/
active-sites.dat
monitoring_site_locations.dat
monitoring_site_locations.csv
4-AQS_Flagging_EPA.pdf
www/MDEQ_Logo.gif
deploy.R
